//- The parts of a run's score as the maze view and sign pages show them: the map with the item
//- points, the reliability bonus, the exit bonus and the misidentifications. Their sum is
//- common/maze_2026_summary.pug. See line_view.css.
//- The map with the item points
section.rv-card.rv-map#rv-items
